2. OUTCOME FILTER: Studies focusing on alloimmunization (84, 86, 95) or transfusion reactions (87, 89) rather than      
bleeding prevention were excluded, even if they were RCTs in relevant populations.                                      
                                                                                                                        
3. POPULATION FILTER: Studies in general ICU patients (85) without specific haematological disorders were excluded.     
                                                                                                                        
4. CONSERVATIVE APPROACH: Study 83 was included despite uncertainty about randomization because it appears to be a      
